=== Summary ===
  A_lexical: gold ranks #1 by raw ratio in all tasks, but 4/12 gold blocks
    fall below production threshold (0.5 for RU questions).
  B_encoder: gold ranks #1 in 9/12 tasks. In 2 cases a same-project
    distractor (default-timeout block) beats the gold block for timeout questions.
    Separation between gold and hard negatives (wrong project) is clear:
    gold scores 0.53-0.93, hard negatives 0.05-0.20.

  RED for production: lexical threshold rejects 4/12 gold blocks (RU/mixed).
  B_encoder does NOT perfectly separate: 2 distractors beat gold.
  M2b calibration needed to find threshold that admits gold without admitting
    same-project distractors.

